[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5249673466","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122285#issuecomment-5249673466","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122285","id":5249673466,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOOeo-g","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T06:15:59Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T06:30:39Z","body":"> I did notice that the underlines are harder to see now\r\n\r\nThat depends on the available display / gpu / renderer and is a side effect of being an actual line mesh that renders as a gpu line, not a full polygon faking as \"thin line\".\r\n\r\nThat polyline created a \"thin\" polygon, quadrupling the processing and rendering cost. Together with its alloc is why polyline consumed so much performance especially on weaker hardware with opengl.\r\n\r\nWe replaced that from Path2D as well in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105606 because the old line-with-tiny-width drawing made the entire editor lag on larger paths and scenes and did not work at high zoom level due to overlap. At some point you need to compromise between visual \"beauty\" and usable performance and visual clarity.\r\n\r\nOne way to make it better visible would be to add an option that draws a second line with an offset mesh. That is what e.g. 3D does to make the lines \"thick\" while still not using a full polygon. I guess that would need to be performance tested and / or turned into an option because the entire reason we are doing this PR exercise is because users had too much performance issues with the \"looks nicer\" version. I think using a custom shader that replaces the line drawing with rect textures would likely be better in any case, just far more work.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5249673466/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5251001494","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122285#issuecomment-5251001494","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122285","id":5251001494,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOPvslg","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T08:49:48Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T08:49:48Z","body":"Okay guys, we now have in a short time a lot of different desires both here and in dev chat.\r\n\r\nWhat I will do now is close this PR and slap a salvageable label on it and you guys can all pick the small code pieces that you like and ignore all the code pieces that you dont like at your own discretion. If you do you don't even need to credit me because I don't give a d about numbers go up.\r\n\r\nThe entire reason I made this PR is because I witnessed your \"panic\" discussion about releasing that new feature with such low performance. You now know how you can solve that so I consider my main job done and if you have questions you know where to ping me.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5251001494/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5256048587","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122285#issuecomment-5256048587","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122285","id":5256048587,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOUjvyw","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscr